# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go). Source directories are
# named because Podman does not descend into ignored directories; add new
# top-level Go source directories here too.
!**/*.go
!cmd
!api
!internal
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum
